/-!
# Odd-core and plane geometry of the restricted cyclic actions

The actual restricted models supply the odd-core commutator characterization
of the common involution image and both numerical plane alternatives.
The original action, subgroup intersections and full-support convention are
retained throughout. Restricted-model recognition is the remaining premise,
owned by the final qt-e-152-action-plane assembly.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith 15.2.13(2) and 15.2.14(2), printed pp.1111--1112,
combined manuscript of 1 March 2004, refs/quasithin.pdf.
-/
